ave your mark on the world and determine the fate of the galaxy with your decisions.","detailedDescription":"Space Menace is an epic sci-fi space RTS and battle game that puts you in the captain's chair, with the fate of the galaxy in your hands. Starting off small with just one ship, you'll embark on an incredible journey that will see you rise to glory and fortune through a combination of cunning strategy, tactical prowess, and resource management.\n\nWith multiple paths to progress, you can earn money through freelance missions or simply by taking on other ships and collecting valuable salvage. As you expand your fleet and equip it with weapons, utilities, and strike craft, you'll face surprising elements and make critical decisions that will determine your survival in the hostile and unforgiving vacuum of space.\n\nAt the heart of Space Menace is a deep and immersive gameplay experience that combines top-down 2D battles, customization options for your fleet, and a rich sci-fi setting that is sure to keep you engaged for hours on end. As you earn the favor or scorn of powerful factions, you'll need to carefully plan your attacks and defenses, leveraging friendly ships and space stations to your advantage. \n\nIs This Game for You?\n\n• \nMinimal story and dialogue\n\n• \nAccessible gameplay over complexity\n\n• \nMinimal tutorial and a quick jump into the action\n\n• \nControl several ships using RTS-style controls instead of directly flying ships with WASD\n\n• \nGetting better ships, improving your fleet, customizing loadouts, completing missions, and fighting space battles are the main focus\n\nIf you're looking for deep economic simulation, detailed diplomacy, empire management, or traditional grand-strategy gameplay, this game may not be what you're looking for.\n\nThere is a free demo available, so feel free to try it first.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame"